      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This really needs to be added, it's ridiculous how people who commission avatars either have to risk their account security by giving the person making the avatar their password just so it's private or have their personal avatar out there in the open able to be used by anybody and possibly ripped, there is no in between.",
